    "turn_idx": 5,
    "turn_text": "So over the last few months, you have been pushing back against a Defense Department policy relating to abortion. As my colleague Rob Bluey has previously written for the Daily Signal, you are currently blocking the promotions of more than 300 flag officers and military generals over objections to the Defense Department's new taxpayer-funded abortion policy. First and foremost, can you tell us a little bit about why you're against this policy and your efforts over the last couple of months?",
