  {
    "episode_id": 83164,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/3/83164.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 16,
    "turn_text": "Well, I think there's a lot of people out of touch up here with reality. about real life, about our country. In our country's in trouble. We're in trouble in a lot of different ways. We're losing our identity as the place to live in the world. I mean, we have a lot of people coming here for a better life across the border. But you can look at what's happening with countries like Russia and Brazil and South America, India, China. They're creating their own world around them, called BRICS, using their own currency. They're controlling mostly all in the world as we speak now if you control the energy in this in the in on the faith All over the world that we live in you control the world and of course Joe Biden his administration They believe in doing away with fossil fuels and you can't do that. They know it. We know it but they're trying to pull some foolish trick to try to put us in a situation where we're beholding to Iran, Venezuela, Russia, all those other people that have all and it's not going to work.",
